James Of Tucson wrote:
> Is it possible to game the ring hunger code by wearing it on the right
> hand, only 11 turns on and 9 turns off?
>
> Also does left ring hunger really get checked more often than right?

Mostly, but not completely, spoily answer:
It is possible to game the ring hunger code by moving the ring from
one hand to another at predetermined intervals. The ring hunger is
checked equally often for each hand, but at different times; so if you
have precise enough timing with moving the ring, you can reduce the
ring hunger to 0. Note that this requires two rings in order to have
the ring effect at all times whilst having no ring hunger; also, ring
hunger is normally insignificant. The only time you might actually
want to do this is with two rings of slow digestion, so they reduce
your hunger rate to actually 0, rather than nearly 0, which might be
useful with certain types of conduct ascension. (Few people have the
discipline to pull this trick off, though.)


